  "description": "Calculate the sum of all integers in a nested list, weighted by their depth.",
  "target": null,
  "pseudocode": "function depthSum(list, depth = 1) {\n  let sum = 0;\n  for (let item of list) {\n    if (Number.isInteger(item)) {\n      sum += item * depth;\n    } else {\n      sum += depthSum(item, depth + 1);\n    }\n  }\n  return sum;\n}",
